## Controlled Blinded Validation

Use LAVENDER_CURRENT_PARFUM_V1_4_CITRUS_QUARTET_BLIND_VALIDATION.md. C4 first faces untouched V1.3 and all equal-dose siblings. If it survives, test 0/30/60/90 uL Bergamot FCF with DEP 1,035/1,005/975/945 uL, all else fixed. Advancement requires greater movement, lavender identity, seamless transition, comfort, depth, and re-smell desire without cologne, Earl-Grey, barbershop, excessive-softness, or generic-aromatic vetoes. Composite OAV may not rank arms.

No arm may be prepared until bottle/lot identity, current safety documents, Ambrofix homogeneity/carrier, Evernyl/Coumarin bases, and labeled Javanol stock are resolved. No procurement, stock preparation, compounding, evaluation, recruitment, or release is authorized.

**Final status:** THEORY ONLY / NOT TESTED / PHYSICAL EXECUTION BLOCKED.

